{
  "job_B9.2.5_20251003_114956": {
    "chunk_text": "\u00dea on \u00f0\u00e6m gefeohte \u00fee hie \u00fe\u00e6t f\u00e6sten brecan woldon, w\u00e6s Romana fela mid flanum ofscotod, \u00dea se consul ongeat \u00fe\u00e6t hie \u00f0\u00e6t f\u00e6sten abrecan ne mehton, \u00fea bebead he sumum \u00fe\u00e6m folce \u00fe\u00e6t On \u00fe\u00e6m fleame \u00fee \u00fea burgware eft wi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6s f\u00e6stennes flugon, hiera wear\u00f0 ofslagen XL M, & On \u00fe\u00e6m dagum for Marcus se consul on Ligor \u00fe\u00e6t land, & gefliemed wear\u00f0, & his folces \u00dea \u00fea Marcus Claudius & Marcellus Quintus w\u00e6ron consulas, Philippus M\u00e6cedonia cyning & \u00feeh \u00fee he swa gedyde, \u00fea he ham com, Philippus het his o\u00feerne sunu \u00fe\u00e6t he hiene mid atre On \u00f0\u00e6re ilcan tide Hannibal his agnum willum hine selfne mid atre acwealde. On \u00fe\u00e6re tide o\u00f0ewde Fulcania \u00fe\u00e6t iglond on Sicilium, \u00fe\u00e6t n\u00e6s gesewen \u00e6r \u00fea. On \u00fe\u00e6re tide Quintius Fuluius se consul gefeaht wi\u00f0 \u00fea firran Ispanie, & sige h\u00e6fde. \u00dea \u00fea Lapidus Mutius w\u00e6s consul, wolde seo strengeste \u00feeod winnan on Romane, \u00fee mon \u00fea het Hie woldon Perseuse to fultume M\u00e6cedonia cyninge. \u00dea w\u00e6s Donua seo ea swa swi\u00fee oferfroren, \u00fe\u00e6t hie getruwedon \u00fe\u00e6t hie ofer \u00fe\u00e6m ise faran \u00dea \u00fea Plicinius Crassus & Gaius Casius w\u00e6ron consulas, \u00fea gewear\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t M\u00e6cedonisce gewin, & ra\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6s \u00fee hie tosomne comon Romane wurdon gefliemde, & ra\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6s \u00e6t o\ufffd",
